	(text "The REGN LDO supplies internal bias circuits and the MOSFETs gate drivers. \nThe pull-up rails of ILIM_HIZ, TS, and STAT can be connected to REGN.\nThe REGN is not recommended to source any other external circuit!"
		(at 59.436 134.874 0)
		(effects
